# Specialist choices appear in the chat settings before its first message.
size 1100x900
file .agents/specialists/reviewer/SPECIALIST.md <<END
---
name: reviewer
description: Review changes for bugs
model: sonnet
limits: read-only
---
Review changes and report concrete bugs with file references.
END
keys <C-;>:Agent claude<CR>
keys i
sleep 200
click 245 808
shot specialist-menu
click 819 433
wait-for Create specialist
shot specialist-settings-shortcut
keys <Esc>
click 245 808
keys <Tab><Down><CR>
sleep 200
shot specialist-selected
size 480x640
click 80 548
shot specialist-narrow
keys <Esc>
size 1100x900
type hello
keys <CR>
wait-for echo: hello
click 245 808
shot specialist-locked
